catalog/sources.jsonl lists titles and URLs taken from free-programming-books
(https://github.com/EbookFoundation/free-programming-books), licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), and from the Hillside Group's patterns
catalog (https://hillside.net/patterns/patterns-catalog). Only those facts (title, URL,
section, stated license) are reproduced; the commit and fetch date are in catalog/meta.json.

No text or code was copied from the books and pages the catalog lists. Every explanation and
every line of code in src/, skills/ and dataset/ was written for this repository; the sources
are cited by catalog ID.
